    {
        "content": "<p>alexcrichton <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14897#issuecomment-6350031917\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14897\">PR #14897</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Ah I believe <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/actions/runs/39838492788/job/120033136219\">this failure</a> is not spurious</p>\n</blockquote>",
